# Testing

- Framework: **Vitest** + **@testing-library/react**; `vitest.setup.ts` registers **MSW** and `jest-dom`.
- Query tests with **`getByRole`** where possible; use **`data-test-id`** for stable selectors when needed.
- Wrap components that use **react-router** in **`MemoryRouter`** (see `Table.test.tsx` and similar).
- New network behavior: extend **`mocks/handlers.ts`** (and `mocks/data/` if needed) so tests do not hit real APIs. Match URLs to test env: `https://test-api.example.com/` and `https://test-app.example.com` (see `vite.config.ts` test `env` and `vitest.setup.ts`).
- Keep tests focused and colocated: `Feature.tsx` → `Feature.test.tsx`.
